<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="google-site-verification" content="hK7TpxV7vuEkO3PJkUcMAsZw4VzaJJk7XY9cJeCKsM0">
    <%- include('partials/adsense') %>
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#194f45">
    <title>Chen Laoshi's Teaching Toolkit</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/site-theme.css">
    <style>
        .home-hero {
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            isolation: isolate;
            padding: 28px 20px 58px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #103e37 0%, #194f45 56%, #39745a 100%);
            color: #fff9e9;
        }
        .home-hero::before,
        .home-hero::after {
            position: absolute;
            z-index: -1;
            content: '';
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 2px solid rgba(255, 249, 233, 0.18);
        }
        .home-hero::before { width: 520px; height: 520px; top: -355px; right: -80px; }
        .home-hero::after { width: 240px; height: 240px; bottom: -175px; left: 7%; }
        .top-note {
            max-width: 1160px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding-top: 50px;
            color: #f8dc81;
            font-size: .78rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: .12em;
            text-align: center;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .hero-content {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(280px, .8fr);
            align-items: center;
            gap: 44px;
            max-width: 1060px;
            margin: 20px auto 0;
        }
        .hero-copy { max-width: 610px; }
        .eyebrow {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
            padding: 7px 14px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 249, 233, .44);
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .08);
            color: #ffe49a;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: .03em;
        }
        .hero-copy h1 {
            max-width: 580px;
            margin: 0;
            color: #fffdf7;
            font-family: 'DM Serif Display', 'Noto Sans SC', serif;
            font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5.5rem);
            font-weight: 400;
            letter-spacing: -.035em;
            line-height: .98;
        }
        .hero-copy h1 span { display: block; color: #f8c63f; font-family: 'Inter Variable', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: .45em; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: .04em; line-height: 1.3; }
        .hero-copy p { max-width: 550px; margin: 30px 0 32px; color: rgba(255, 253, 247, .86); font-size: 1.1rem; }
        /* Keep these routes ready for later, without promoting sections that are still growing. */
        .hero-buttons { display: none; }
        .hero-buttons .btn { padding: 12px 19px; }
        .hero-buttons .btn-secondary {
            border-color: rgba(255, 249, 233, .62) !important;
            background: rgba(255, 253, 247, .10) !important;
            box-shadow: none;
        }
        .hero-buttons .btn-secondary:hover { background: rgba(255, 253, 247, .20) !important; box-shadow: none; }
        .hero-avatar-wrap {
            position: relative;
            justify-self: center;
            width: min(350px, 78vw);
            padding: 12px;
        }
        .hero-avatar-wrap::before {
            position: absolute;
            inset: 14% -2% 5%;
            z-index: -1;
            content: '';
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #f8c63f;
            filter: blur(1px);
            transform: rotate(8deg);
        }
        .hero-avatar-wrap::after {
            position: absolute;
            top: 13%;
            right: -4%;
            width: 57px;
            height: 57px;
            content: '✦';
            color: #f8c63f;
            font-size: 3rem;
            line-height: 57px;
            text-align: center;
            transform: rotate(13deg);
        }
        .teacher-avatar { position: relative; overflow: hidden; border: 6px solid #fff6db; border-radius: 50%; background: #194f45; box-shadow: 0 0 0 7px #f8c63f, 0 19px 35px rgba(8, 45, 38, .35); }
        .teacher-avatar img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
        .teacher-avatar::after { position: absolute; right: 11%; bottom: 5%; content: '陈老师'; color: #194f45; font-family: 'Noto Sans SC', sans-serif; font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .08em; }
        .section-intro { max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 62px 20px 0; text-align: center; }
        .section-intro .eyebrow { border-color: #d7e3c7; background: #edf5df; color: #356e57; }
        .section-intro h2 { margin: 0; color: #194f45; font-family: 'DM Serif Display', 'Noto Sans SC', serif; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.1; }
        .section-intro p { margin: 13px auto 0; color: #5d7168; }
        .main-sections { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 22px; max-width: 1160px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 34px 20px 66px; }
        .home-card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-height: 360px; padding: 30px; border: 1px solid #e5ddc9; border-radius: 22px; background: #fffdf7; box-shadow: 0 10px 26px rgba(24, 66, 55, .1); transition: transform .18s ease, box-shadow .18s ease; }
        .home-card:hover { transform: translateY(-7px) rotate(-.35deg); box-shadow: 0 18px 34px rgba(24, 66, 55, .16); }
        .card-icon { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 56px; height: 56px; margin-bottom: 18px; border-radius: 17px; font-size: 1.8rem; }
        .theme-card .card-icon { background: #edf5df; }
        .prep-card .card-icon { background: #fff0c5; }
        .tools-card .card-icon { background: #f9dfd6; }
        .home-card h3 { margin: 0; color: #194f45; font-family: 'DM Serif Display', 'Noto Sans SC', serif; font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 400; }
        .home-card p { margin: 12px 0 22px; color: #5d7168; }
        .home-card .activity-btn { align-self: flex-start; margin-top: auto; padding: 10px 16px; }
        .featured { position: relative; overflow: hidden; padding: 64px 20px 70px; background: #edf5df; text-align: center; }
        /* Reserved for future teacher testimonials. */
        .featured { display: none; }
        .featured::before { position: absolute; top: -16px; left: 6%; content: '✷'; color: #f8c63f; font-size: 5rem; opacity: .75; }
        .featured h2 { position: relative; margin: 0 0 28px; color: #194f45; font-family: 'DM Serif Display', 'Noto Sans SC', serif; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem); font-weight: 400; }
        .featured-items { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; max-width: 1050px; margin: 0 auto; }
        .featured-item { padding: 26px; text-align: left; }
        .featured-item:nth-child(1) { border-top: 6px solid #f8c63f !important; }
        .featured-item:nth-child(2) { border-top: 6px solid #c9503f !important; }
        .featured-item:nth-child(3) { border-top: 6px solid #6f9e72 !important; }
        .featured-item h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; color: #194f45; font-family: 'DM Serif Display', 'Noto Sans SC', serif; font-size: 1.35rem; }
        .featured-item p { margin: 0; color: #5d7168; }
        .shop-preview { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(260px, .85fr); max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e5ddc9; border-radius: 24px; background: #fffdf7; box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(24, 66, 55, .11); }
        .shop-preview-copy { padding: 42px; }
        .shop-preview .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 14px; border-color: #f1d58c; background: #fff2c5; color: #8a5b15; }
        .shop-preview h2 { margin: 0; color: #194f45; font-family: 'DM Serif Display', 'Noto Sans SC', serif; font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.6vw, 2.8rem); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.08; }
        .shop-preview p { max-width: 520px; margin: 15px 0 22px; color: #5d7168; line-height: 1.65; }
        .shop-preview img { width: 100%; height: 100%; min-height: 320px; object-fit: cover; object-position: center; }
        .shop-preview .shop-note { margin: 15px 0 0; color: #7c651f; font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 800; }
        .grade-nav { padding: 48px 20px 58px; border: 0; background: #fff9e9; text-align: center; }
        .grade-nav h3 { margin: 0 0 18px; color: #194f45; font-family: 'DM Serif Display', 'Noto Sans SC', serif; font-size: 1.65rem; font-weight: 400; }
        .grade-buttons { gap: 10px; }
        .grade-btn { border: 1px solid #cbdac2; border-radius: 999px; background: #fffdf7; color: #356e57; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 800; transition: transform .15s ease, background-color .15s ease; }
        .grade-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); background: #356e57; color: white; }
        .feedback-section {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: minmax(220px, .58fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
            gap: 34px;
            max-width: 1120px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 64px 20px 70px;
            align-items: start;
        }
        .feedback-copy { padding: 24px 0; }
        .feedback-copy .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 15px; border-color: #d7e3c7; background: #edf5df; color: #356e57; }
        .feedback-copy h2 { margin: 0; color: #194f45; font-family: 'DM Serif Display', 'Noto Sans SC', serif; font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.6vw, 2.8rem); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.08; }
        .feedback-copy p { max-width: 390px; margin: 16px 0 0; color: #5d7168; line-height: 1.65; }
        .feedback-note { display: inline-flex; margin-top: 20px; padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #d7e3c7; border-radius: 999px; background: #fffdf7; color: #356e57; font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 800; }
        .feedback-form-wrap { min-height: 530px; overflow: hidden; padding: 0 clamp(24px, 2.6vw, 40px); border: 1px solid #e5ddc9; border-radius: 22px; background: #fffdf7; box-shadow: 0 10px 26px rgba(24, 66, 55, .1); }
        .feedback-form-wrap iframe { display: block; width: 100%; min-height: 530px; border: 0; }
        footer { padding: 25px 20px; }
        footer p { margin: 0; }
        @media (min-width: 821px) {
            .home-hero { min-height: 450px; padding: 0 20px 30px; }
            .hero-content { gap: 36px; margin-top: 8px; }
            .hero-avatar-wrap { width: min(320px, 78vw); padding: 10px; }
        }
        @media (max-width: 820px) { .hero-content { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; text-align: center; } .hero-copy { margin: 0 auto; } .hero-buttons { justify-content: center; } .hero-avatar-wrap { grid-row: 1; } .main-sections, .featured-items, .feedback-section, .shop-preview { grid-template-columns: 1fr; max-width: 540px; } .shop-preview-copy { padding: 32px; } .shop-preview img { min-height: 245px; max-height: 320px; } .feedback-section { gap: 10px; padding-top: 46px; padding-bottom: 52px; } .feedback-copy { padding-top: 0; } }
        @media (max-width: 520px) { .home-hero { padding: 22px 16px 44px; } .top-note { max-width: 520px; font-size: .65rem; letter-spacing: .08em; line-height: 1.45; } .hero-avatar-wrap { width: min(280px, 80vw); } .main-sections { padding: 27px 16px 48px; } .home-card { min-height: 305px; } .featured { padding: 49px 16px; } .shop-preview { margin: 0 16px; } .shop-preview-copy { padding: 28px; } }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <!-- Impact-Site-Verification: 65267fd0-0a53-4615-8961-483203ad4f9c -->
    <section class="home-hero">
        <div class="top-note">✦ Chen Laoshi’s Teaching - Toolkit ready-to-use activities and tools for your classroom. ✦</div>
        <div class="hero-content">
            <div class="hero-copy">
                <h1>Chen Laoshi’s<br>Teaching Toolkit<span>陈老师的课堂资源站</span></h1>
                <p>A practical, welcoming space for language teachers—filled with classroom-ready activities, thoughtful tools, and everyday inspiration.</p>
                <div class="hero-buttons">
                    <a href="/theme-activities" class="btn">Explore activities</a>
                    <a href="/teaching-tools" class="btn btn-secondary">Open teacher tools</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-avatar-wrap">
                <div class="teacher-avatar">
                    <img src="/images/chen-laoshi-logo.svg" alt="Chen Laoshi holding a book, surrounded by sunflowers and classroom supplies">
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-intro">
        <div class="eyebrow">A little help for every school day</div>
        <h2>Pick a path, then make it your own.</h2>
        <p>Everything is organized to help you turn a good idea into a confident, engaging lesson.</p>
    </section>

    <main class="main-sections">
        <article class="home-card theme-card" id="theme">
            <div class="card-icon">🎯</div>
            <h3>Theme Activities</h3>
            <p>Browse lessons, games, and classroom-ready ideas by topic—from weather and seasons to cultural celebrations.</p>
            <a href="/theme-activities" class="activity-btn">See the themes →</a>
        </article>
        <article class="home-card prep-card" id="low-prep">
            <div class="card-icon">⚡</div>
            <h3>Low-Prep Wins</h3>
            <p>Fast activities for busy teaching days: warm-ups, speaking games, printables, and flexible plans you can use right away.</p>
            <a href="/low-prep-activities" class="activity-btn">Find a quick activity →</a>
        </article>
        <article class="home-card tools-card" id="tools">
            <div class="card-icon">🧩</div>
            <h3>Teacher Tools</h3>
            <p>Simple digital helpers for the small tasks that add up—group making, QR worksheets, and more.</p>
            <a href="/teaching-tools" class="activity-btn">Open the tool shelf →</a>
        </article>
    </main>

    <section class="shop-preview" aria-labelledby="shop-preview-heading">
        <div class="shop-preview-copy">
            <div class="eyebrow">🧲 Classroom finds</div>
            <h2 id="shop-preview-heading">A few joyful classroom helpers.</h2>
            <p>Occasional teacher-friendly supplies, carefully described and ready for a new classroom. The first find: colorful magnetic people for displays, storytelling, and playful language practice.</p>
            <a href="/classroom-shop" class="btn">Visit the classroom shop →</a>
            <p class="shop-note">Open-box finds · Shipping included</p>
        </div>
        <img src="/images/magnetic-people-classroom.png" alt="Colorful magnetic people holding classroom artwork on a magnetic board">
    </section>

    <section class="featured">
        <h2>From Chen Laoshi's desk</h2>
        <div class="featured-items">
            <article class="featured-item">
                <h3>Fresh classroom ideas</h3>
                <p>A growing collection of approachable lesson ideas to keep your planning feeling light.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="featured-item">
                <h3>Tools that save time</h3>
                <p>Open a focused tool, get the job done, and bring your attention back to your students.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="featured-item">
                <h3>Seasonal sparks</h3>
                <p>Use timely prompts and themes to make each unit feel connected to the world outside.</p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="feedback-section" id="feedback" aria-labelledby="feedback-heading">
        <div class="feedback-copy">
            <div class="eyebrow">💌 Your voice matters</div>
            <h2 id="feedback-heading">Help this toolkit grow.</h2>
            <p>What would make your teaching day easier? Share a feature idea, suggestion, or bug you found. I read every message.</p>
            <span class="feedback-note">🌻 Feedback goes directly to Chen Laoshi</span>
        </div>
        <div class="feedback-form-wrap">
            <iframe data-tally-src="https://tally.so/embed/GxEBPk?alignLeft=1&amp;hideTitle=1&amp;transparentBackground=1&amp;dynamicHeight=1" loading="lazy" title="Share feedback with Chen Laoshi"></iframe>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>© 2026 Chen Laoshi's Teaching Toolkit · Made with care for curious classrooms.</p>
    </footer>
    <script src="/javascripts/account-coming-soon.js"></script>
    <script src="/javascripts/milk-tea-footer.js"></script>
    <script async src="https://tally.so/widgets/embed.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
